  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (2) Performance</p><p>You know just how to annoy someone at the worst possible time.</p><ul><li><p>You have a number of <strong>distraction points</strong> equal to your <strong>Soul</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Once per turn, you can expend a <strong>distraction point</strong> to irritate another creature as a <strong>Free Action</strong> on your turn. If you do so, that creature has <strong>-1 penalty dice</strong> to the next check it makes within <strong>1 hour</strong>.</p></li><li><p>You replenish your <strong>distraction points</strong> after you finish a <strong>Short</strong> or <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
